LUMA SUMMARY:
Major archive/debug session. OOK produces a new MASTER_INDEX, then Cozmo has the Minds inspect a DeepSeek disconnect. The logs show repeated DeepSeek input-location failures before QS marks the node unavailable, supporting a browser/UI availability failure rather than a simple relay-content problem. The session also becomes philosophical and playful—1430, puns, contextual compression, local LLMs, libraries, calculus, and Murphy—and ends with a successful DeepSeek reconnect followed by reports that QS is duplicating/out-of-sync messages.</summary>
